# Stage 8 golden tour (M6, D-036 style): the real game from the title with
# the run started in Bad Ischl (`level = bad_ischl`, D-047): START at frame
# 21, stage intro 21..170, then the inputs of bad_ischl_solver.replay
# unchanged from frame 171 (re-copy them after `cargo xtask solve
# bad_ischl --write`; the xtask tour coupling test checks it), then 800
# idle frames: the Maibaum sequence at Café Zauner (no Ortsende, D-097),
# the tally, the route map Bad Ischl -> Café Zauner (2508), which has no
# level yet, so the teaser („Fortsetzung folgt …", 2572) and the title
# (2752) with the run reset. D-102 (E42): re-copied from the re-solved
# route (solver frames 918-1545 changed); time_limit 210 (was 270)
# shortens the tally by 60 frames, so the map, the teaser shot (2700 ->
# 2640) and the title come 60 frames earlier.
# Play frame = tour frame - 171 (stage clock likewise until the goal).
# Shots, per section:
#   1 Katrin          60 intro, 260 the Kaiser statue with the pigeon on
#                     his hat brim, 384 Kurgast #1 just stomped into his
#                     deck chair under Resi („Kurruhe!")
#   2 Kaiserpark      527 a stomp on file A below the terrace („Abtreten!")
#   3 Esplanade       958 Kurgast #3 stomped on the promenade over the
#                     Ischl („Kurruhe!"), 1144 the checkpoint joke
#                     „Bus 150 / fährt zurück"
#   4 Kurpark         1438 a stomp on file B's rear officer in the pen
#   5 Theater         1640 the Kongresshaus balconies with singer #1's
#                     high C, 1817 file C in „Präsentiert!" (sabres up,
#                     drill frame 205; Resi on the 3-high step past it)
#   6 Pfarrgasse      2022 Maibaum, 2100 the goal sequence: Resi walks
#                     past the queue at Café Zauner (D-101 condition),
#                     2200 tally, 2640 the teaser on the route map (Café
#                     Zauner, primary label slots), Normal form.
